            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.12</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>"Take notes" asks as soon as your call starts.</b> Jarvis now notices
      your camera turning on in a call or browser, so the pill appears in the
      waiting room instead of twenty seconds after you join.</li>
  <li>The quiet "Take notes" pill now leaves when the call ends, instead of
      staying on screen.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
