        <item>
            <title>0.19.11</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:13:15 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1911</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.11</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.11</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>A small recording pill above the Dock.</b> While Jarvis takes notes,
      a pill with a live waveform and a stop button sits at the bottom of the
      screen instead of a banner in the notch. Hover the waveform and click to
      open the live notes; drag the pill anywhere you like.</li>
  <li><b>"Take notes" asks from the same spot.</b> When a call starts, the
      pill offers to take notes for five seconds, then quietly steps aside
      for the rest of the call.</li>
  <li>Opening a meeting in its first two minutes no longer shows a blank
      page.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
